009614Z_61_imageprocessorclient-tvplus-linear-796646965d-tj4fd.jpeg"},{"s":1795880534,"e":1795883640,"t":"Episodio 160","d":"Eustaquia le cuenta a Marisela sobre la pérdida del bebé. Genoveva sorprende a Pajarote con Celeste.","i":"https://tvpnlogopus.samsungcloud.tv/platform/image/contents/vc/00/LINEAR/US_USQT620324A_2704454324_2_20260324T235001383Z_81_imageprocessorclient-tvplus-linear-796646965d-tj4fd.jpeg"},{"s":1795883640,"e":1795886746,"t":"Episodio 161","d":"Marisela le cuenta a Santos sobre su madre. Gonzalo descubre que el Sapo es enemigo de Bárbara.","i":"https://tvpnlogopus.samsungcloud.tv/platform/image/contents/vc/00/LINEAR/US_USQT620324A_2704447471_3_20260324T235010833Z_138_imageprocessorclient-tvplus-linear-796646965d-zfwhk.jpeg"}]